3293
01:40:29,019 --> 01:40:32,189
<b>this connecting identity and position.</b>

3294
01:40:32,322 --> 01:40:33,056
<b>Connecting everyone.</b>

3295
01:40:33,056 --> 01:40:33,657
<b>Connecting everyone.</b>

3296
01:40:33,657 --> 01:40:34,758
<b>Everyone needs it.</b>

3297
01:40:34,758 --> 01:40:35,459
