3314
01:41:02,919 --> 01:41:06,023
<b>So NYU's positioning in AI is also very good.</b>

3315
01:41:06,023 --> 01:41:08,792
<b>So actually, uh, again,</b>

3316
01:41:08,792 --> 01:41:09,159
<b>I think</b>

3317
