3328
01:41:31,515 --> 01:41:32,315
<b>Right. Mm.</b>

3329
01:41:32,349 --> 01:41:33,950
<b>Or rather, it was he who chose me.</b>

3330
01:41:33,950 --> 01:41:34,751
<b>Mm.</b>

3331
01:41:35,419 --> 01:41:35,952
<b>Important people.</b>

3332
01:41:35,952 --> 01:41:36,953
<b>Are there others?</b>

3333
01:41:37,754 --> 01:41:39,556
<b>Mm. I think there are.</b>

3334
01:41:39,556 --> 01:41:43,527
<b>For example, during my time at NYU,</b>

3335
01:41:43,527 --> 01:41:47,964
