3338
01:41:52,335 --> 01:41:53,336
<b>Right.</b>

3339
01:41:53,336 --> 01:41:54,805
<b>I think Professor Li Fei-Fei —</b>

3340
01:41:55,439 --> 01:41:58,175
<b>uh, everyone should definitely read the book she wrote.</b>

3341
01:41:58,175 --> 01:41:59,242
