3342
01:41:59,276 --> 01:42:00,644
<b>Right.</b>

3343
01:42:00,644 --> 01:42:01,578
<b>And I've read it too.</b>

3344
01:42:01,578 --> 01:42:04,781
<b>But after having deep conversations with her,</b>

3345
01:42:04,781 --> 01:42:06,249
<b>I gained even more.</b>

3346
01:42:06,516 --> 01:42:09,786
<b>Right. Sometimes I would</b>

3347
01:42:09,786 --> 01:42:10,554
<b>tell her</b>

3348
01:42:10,554 --> 01:42:12,322
