3575
01:49:45,808 --> 01:49:47,877
<b>Right, architecture is one thing,</b>

3576
01:49:47,877 --> 01:49:49,412
<b>your architecture is one thing,</b>

3577
01:49:49,779 --> 01:49:52,015
<b>and your data is also important.</b>

3578
01:49:52,015 --> 01:49:52,782
