02:53:37,436 --> 02:53:39,839
<b>a story that has no conflict from beginning to end</b>

5702
02:53:39,839 --> 02:53:41,240
<b>a good story must be driven by conflict</b>

5703
02:53:41,607 --> 02:53:43,142
