8933
04:33:11,004 --> 04:33:12,238
<b>Large Language Models</b>

8934
04:33:12,639 --> 04:33:13,907
<b>gave you a certain degree of</b>

8935
04:33:13,907 --> 04:33:16,242
<b>cognitive ability about the real world</b>

8936
04:33:16,242 --> 04:33:17,610
<b>it forms one element</b>

8937
04:33:17,610 --> 04:33:18,812
<b>mm-hmm, it forms one element</b>

8938
04:33:18,812 --> 04:33:20,613
<b>but this thing</b>

8939
04:33:20,613 --> 04:33:22,482
<b>as I said, is fundamentally flawed</b>

8940
04:33:22,482 --> 04:33:25,885
<b>because its cognition is too indirect</b>

8941
04:33:25,885 --> 04:33:26,419
<b>yeah</b>

8942
04:33:26,419 --> 04:33:29,389
<b>what language can give you is really just too little</b>

8943
04:33:29,389 --> 04:33:30,390
<b>mm-hmm, right</b>

8944
04:33:30,457 --> 04:33:32,258
<b>and language has other problems too</b>

8945
04:33:32,258 --> 04:33:33,226
<b>namely it is a</b>

8946
04:33:33,226 --> 04:33:34,694
<b>fundamentally a communication tool</b>

8947
04:33:34,694 --> 04:33:36,896
<b>so when we use language</b>

8948
04:33:36,896 --> 04:33:39,866
<b>unless you're saying something like</b>

8949
04:33:39,866 --> 04:33:40,834
<b>in a dream state</b>

8950
04:33:40,834 --> 04:33:42,569
<b>like talking in your sleep</b>

8951
04:33:42,569 --> 04:33:43,603
<b>most of the time</b>

8952
04:33:43,603 --> 04:33:45,872
<b>you use language with an intention</b>

8953
04:33:45,872 --> 04:33:47,240
<b>you want to convey a purpose</b>

8954
04:33:47,407 --> 04:33:49,209
<b>so LLMs are more like</b>

8955
04:33:49,209 --> 04:33:52,412
<b>in my view, more like an extension of a search engine</b>

8956
04:33:52,512 --> 04:33:54,714
<b>right?</b>
<b>or a chatbot is more like an extension of a search engine</b>

8957
04:33:54,848 --> 04:33:57,384
<b>we always bring the purpose in our mind</b>

8958
04:33:57,384 --> 04:33:58,685
<b>to ask a question</b>

8959
04:33:58,818 --> 04:34:00,220
<b>and expect an answer</b>

8960
04:34:00,220 --> 04:34:01,788
<b>right?</b>

8961
04:34:02,255 --> 04:34:05,125
<b>but this is not what</b>

8962
04:34:05,125 --> 04:34:06,393
