8964
04:34:07,394 --> 04:34:08,495
<b>as I just said</b>

8965
04:34:08,595 --> 04:34:10,530
<b>the World Model in our brain</b>

8966
04:34:10,630 --> 04:34:11,731
<b>is doing a lot of work</b>

8967
04:34:11,765 --> 04:34:13,967
<b>in the background</b>

8968
04:34:13,967 --> 04:34:16,436
<b>there's even a lot of psychology</b>

8969
04:34:16,436 --> 04:34:18,571
<b>some counterintuitive findings</b>

8970
04:34:18,571 --> 04:34:18,972
<b>that say</b>

8971
04:34:18,972 --> 04:34:21,775
<b>your brain has already made the decision for you</b>

8972
04:34:22,108 --> 04:34:23,910
<b>before you decide to</b>

8973
04:34:23,910 --> 04:34:25,812
<b>say there are three buttons on my desk</b>

8974
04:34:26,179 --> 04:34:29,249
