8977
04:34:31,718 --> 04:34:34,187
<b>has already made that decision for me</b>

8978
04:34:34,187 --> 04:34:35,055
<b>this experiment</b>

8979
04:34:35,055 --> 04:34:37,290
<b>is called something like the Libet experiment or something</b>

8980
04:34:37,323 --> 04:34:38,792
<b>it's a controversial experiment</b>

8981
04:34:38,825 --> 04:34:40,493
<b>but what it demonstrates is</b>

8982
04:34:40,493 --> 04:34:42,295
<b>many things are happening in your background</b>

8983
04:34:42,295 --> 04:34:43,997
<b>already happening in your brain</b>

8984
04:34:44,130 --> 04:34:45,365
<b>this is part of your world model</b>

8985
04:34:45,365 --> 04:34:47,066
<b>a Language Model is not like that</b>

8986
04:34:47,066 --> 04:34:49,169
<b>language is just a communication tool</b>

8987
04:34:49,302 --> 04:34:50,270
<b>you always come with a purpose</b>

8988
04:34:50,270 --> 04:34:52,205
<b>throw out a question</b>

8989
04:34:52,205 --> 04:34:53,206
<b>and want to get an answer</b>

8990
04:34:53,206 --> 04:34:54,574
<b>it's also a reasoning tool</b>

8991
04:34:54,774 --> 04:34:55,608
<b>right</b>

8992
04:34:55,608 --> 04:34:56,976
<b>it's also a reasoning tool</b>

8993
04:34:56,976 --> 04:35:00,046
<b>of course, but only a symbolic-level reasoning tool</b>

8994
04:35:00,480 --> 04:35:01,648
<b>so you want to build</b>

8995
04:35:01,648 --> 04:35:04,083
<b>a world model like the human brain</b>

8996
04:35:04,083 --> 04:35:08,588
<b>I think we need to look more and more at people</b>

8997
04:35:09,322 --> 04:35:11,624
<b>mm-hmm, actually not just people</b>

8998
04:35:11,691 --> 04:35:12,625
<b>all kinds of animals</b>

8999
04:35:12,625 --> 04:35:14,694
<b>how their intelligence actually arises</b>

9000
04:35:14,828 --> 04:35:15,695
<b>mm-hmm, right</b>

9001
04:35:15,695 --> 04:35:16,663
<b>let me, let me first conclude</b>

9002
04:35:16,663 --> 04:35:18,231
<b>what I just said</b>

9003
04:35:18,331 --> 04:35:19,065
<b>which is</b>

9004
04:35:19,065 --> 04:35:21,367
<b>why is everyone step by step converging on</b>

9005
04:35:21,367 --> 04:35:22,969
<b>converging on this World Model?</b>

9006
04:35:23,036 --> 04:35:24,804
<b>the reason is language models</b>

9007
04:35:24,804 --> 04:35:25,905
<b>have already shown a bit of</b>

9008
04:35:25,905 --> 04:35:27,707
