9104
04:38:31,624 --> 04:38:32,725
<b>right?</b>

9105
04:38:32,859 --> 04:38:34,827
<b>why if I'm generating a video</b>

9106
04:38:34,994 --> 04:38:37,030
<b>say I have, I don't know</b>

9107
04:38:37,030 --> 04:38:38,264
<b>a running video</b>

9108
04:38:38,631 --> 04:38:40,867
<b>why would I have</b>

9109
04:38:40,867 --> 04:38:43,503
<b>a smooth running state</b>

9110
04:38:43,503 --> 04:38:46,005
<b>rather than suddenly hallucinating three legs</b>

9111
04:38:46,005 --> 04:38:46,906
<b>four legs</b>

9112
04:38:46,973 --> 04:38:48,074
<b>which is more believable</b>

9113
04:38:48,074 --> 04:38:49,575
<b>more probable, right?</b>

9114
04:38:49,575 --> 04:38:50,376
<b>in probability space</b>

9115
04:38:50,376 --> 04:38:51,177
<b>more probable</b>

9116
04:38:51,244 --> 04:38:53,680
<b>this already carries enormous amounts of information</b>

9117
04:38:53,680 --> 04:38:55,181
