9120
04:39:00,420 --> 04:39:00,787
<b>right?</b>

9121
04:39:00,787 --> 04:39:03,189
<b>you already need some understanding of the world</b>

9122
04:39:03,289 --> 04:39:05,625
<b>so this is already more</b>

9123
04:39:05,625 --> 04:39:06,926
<b>in line with the Bitter Lesson in my view</b>

9124
04:39:07,026 --> 04:39:08,328
<b>meaning</b>

9125
04:39:08,328 --> 04:39:12,498
