9131
04:39:20,273 --> 04:39:22,842
<b>the pixels themselves</b>

9132
04:39:22,909 --> 04:39:24,310
<b>but taking it one step further</b>

9133
04:39:24,477 --> 04:39:26,179
<b>pixels themselves might also be wrong</b>

9134
04:39:26,612 --> 04:39:29,615
<b>pixels themselves are also not Bitter Lesson enough</b>

9135
04:39:29,849 --> 04:39:30,650
<b>mm-hmm</b>

