04:39:55,208 --> 04:39:55,975
<b>mm-hmm</b>

9149
04:39:55,975 --> 04:39:57,477
<b>this is also made for humans to see</b>

9150
04:39:58,611 --> 04:39:59,412
<b>right?</b>

9151
04:39:59,979 --> 04:40:01,180
<b>that's why world simulators</b>

9152
04:40:01,180 --> 04:40:02,648
<b>why do people think Genie</b>

9153
04:40:02,648 --> 04:40:03,249
<b>is so cool</b>

9154
04:40:03,249 --> 04:40:05,084
<b>because we create a video</b>

9155
04:40:05,084 --> 04:40:06,252
<b>we create a game</b>

9156
04:40:06,419 --> 04:40:07,520
<b>this is for humans to see</b>

9157
04:40:08,287 --> 04:40:10,089
<b>but taking it one step further</b>

9158
04:40:10,089 --> 04:40:11,691
<b>the real Bitter Lesson says</b>

