12064
06:08:25,212 --> 06:08:26,380
<b>and perceive</b>

12065
06:08:26,480 --> 06:08:28,215
<b>is actually</b>

12066
06:08:28,215 --> 06:08:29,216
<b>approaching zero</b>

12067
06:08:29,517 --> 06:08:30,051
<b>right?</b>

12068
06:08:30,051 --> 06:08:31,986
<b>we are limited by our consciousness</b>

12069
