12070
06:08:34,822 --> 06:08:36,223
<b>bandwidth limitations</b>

12071
06:08:36,257 --> 06:08:37,058
<b>we cannot see</b>

12072
06:08:37,058 --> 06:08:38,726
<b>everything that happens in this world</b>

12073
06:08:38,726 --> 06:08:39,460
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12074
06:08:39,460 --> 06:08:40,061
<b>so</b>

12075
06:08:40,061 --> 06:08:44,265
<b>human intelligence is a very specialized intelligence</b>

12076
06:08:44,965 --> 06:08:46,901
<b>it can only</b>

12077
