<b>humans can only perceive what they can see</b>

12078
06:08:48,903 --> 06:08:49,870
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12079
06:08:49,870 --> 06:08:51,272
<b>and later I also added a tweet about it</b>

12080
06:08:51,272 --> 06:08:52,306
<b>I read a book</b>

12081
06:08:52,306 --> 06:08:56,610
<b>called "Are We Smart Enough to Know How Smart Animals Are?"</b>

12082
06:08:56,610 --> 06:08:58,679
<b>which asks whether we're smart enough</b>

12083
06:08:59,180 --> 06:09:01,015
<b>to know how smart animals are</b>

12084
06:09:01,015 --> 06:09:01,716
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12085
06:09:01,716 --> 06:09:03,718
<b>and after reading this book</b>

12086
06:09:03,784 --> 06:09:06,053
<b>I let go of more of that human arrogance</b>

12087
06:09:06,887 --> 06:09:09,390
<b>I think the evolution of intelligence</b>

12088
06:09:09,390 --> 06:09:10,524
<b>is a continuous process</b>

12089
06:09:10,524 --> 06:09:12,326
<b>it's not one where</b>

12090
