12097
06:09:28,642 --> 06:09:31,378
<b>self-awareness and consciousness</b>

12098
06:09:31,378 --> 06:09:32,613
<b>one laboratory said</b>

12099
06:09:32,613 --> 06:09:33,981
<b>humans can look in a mirror</b>

12100
06:09:33,981 --> 06:09:36,450
