<b>[laughter] right</b>

12109
06:09:47,595 --> 06:09:49,430
<b>anyway, many animals</b>

12110
06:09:49,430 --> 06:09:50,197
<b>indeed can't</b>

12111
06:09:50,197 --> 06:09:51,232
<b>but many animals can</b>

12112
06:09:51,232 --> 06:09:51,899
<b>mm-hmm, right?</b>

12113
06:09:51,899 --> 06:09:54,435
<b>and there are also many very interesting things</b>

12114
06:09:54,435 --> 06:09:55,669
<b>like chimpanzees, right?</b>

12115
06:09:55,669 --> 06:09:57,772
<b>and this author</b>

12116
06:09:57,772 --> 06:09:58,405
<b>so</b>

12117
