12470
06:21:21,221 --> 06:21:22,022
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12471
06:21:22,222 --> 06:21:23,523
<b>when you can't see any light</b>

12472
06:21:23,523 --> 06:21:25,992
<b>you always feel lost and discouraged</b>

12473
06:21:26,493 --> 06:21:28,595
<b>and when people truly feel</b>

12474
06:21:28,595 --> 06:21:30,664
<b>this kind of joy</b>

12475
06:21:30,664 --> 06:21:33,366
<b>it's only when you actually get something working</b>

12476
06:21:33,667 --> 06:21:34,701
<b>but this part of the time</b>

12477
06:21:34,701 --> 06:21:35,969
<b>is very, very brief</b>

12478
06:21:36,269 --> 06:21:39,005
<b>maybe only 5% or 10%</b>

12479
06:21:39,206 --> 06:21:40,774
<b>Kaiming has said something similar</b>

12480
06:21:41,975 --> 06:21:44,010
<b>so over time</b>

12481
06:21:44,010 --> 06:21:45,812
<b>right, eventually everyone's</b>

12482
06:21:45,812 --> 06:21:49,683
<b>mental state can become concerning</b>

12483
06:21:49,683 --> 06:21:50,517
<b>but I think it's okay</b>

12484
06:21:50,517 --> 06:21:51,485
<b>I think</b>

12485
06:21:51,485 --> 06:21:52,452
<b>Uh</b>

12486
06:21:52,452 --> 06:21:53,620
<b>I think this era now</b>

12487
06:21:53,620 --> 06:21:56,590
<b>is still not quite the same as before</b>

12488
06:21:56,590 --> 06:22:00,227
<b>I think now there's more discussion</b>

12489
06:22:00,227 --> 06:22:02,662
<b>I think</b>
<b>this is one of the benefits of this AI wave</b>

12490
06:22:02,662 --> 06:22:03,463
<b>at least</b>

12491
06:22:03,496 --> 06:22:04,431
<b>people won't feel</b>

12492
06:22:04,431 --> 06:22:07,300
<b>like they're in a closed space</b>

12493
06:22:07,501 --> 06:22:08,835
<b>exploring alone</b>

12494
06:22:08,969 --> 06:22:11,505
<b>at least people can scroll through Xiaohongshu</b>

12495
06:22:11,505 --> 06:22:12,906
<b>scroll through Weibo, Zhihu</b>

12496
06:22:12,906 --> 06:22:15,208
<b>and see how everyone is discussing this</b>

12497
06:22:15,208 --> 06:22:17,110
<b>I think that's sometimes quite stress-relieving</b>

12498
06:22:17,210 --> 06:22:19,212
<b>but sometimes it also adds pressure</b>

12499
06:22:19,212 --> 06:22:21,681
<b>when people criticize you, you don't think that anymore</b>

12500
06:22:22,315 --> 06:22:26,419
<b>Does your company have people with an entrepreneurial personality?</b>

12501
06:22:26,419 --> 06:22:27,254
