12502
06:22:27,254 --> 06:22:28,455
<b>generally quite optimistic</b>

12503
06:22:28,889 --> 06:22:31,458
<b>I think Yann himself is very optimistic</b>

12504
06:22:31,458 --> 06:22:32,125
<b>very, very optimistic</b>

12505
06:22:32,125 --> 06:22:33,260
<b>why isn't he a researcher</b>

12506
06:22:33,260 --> 06:22:34,694
<b>with that melancholy undercurrent?</b>

12507
06:22:35,662 --> 06:22:36,897
<b>hmm, I don't know</b>

12508
06:22:36,897 --> 06:22:39,266
<b>because he's been through hardship</b>

12509
06:22:39,266 --> 06:22:40,467
