12524
06:23:03,123 --> 06:23:04,057
<b>is exactly the same</b>

12525
06:23:04,190 --> 06:23:05,025
<b>which thing?</b>

12526
06:23:05,025 --> 06:23:06,426
<b>it's that now, world models</b>

12527
06:23:06,426 --> 06:23:09,629
<b>or whatever you call it</b>

12528
06:23:09,629 --> 06:23:10,130
<b>the current systems</b>

12529
06:23:10,130 --> 06:23:11,564
