12534
06:23:21,875 --> 06:23:24,444
<b>but they're only a small minority</b>

12535
06:23:25,178 --> 06:23:26,379
<b>most people can't see it</b>

12536
06:23:26,813 --> 06:23:27,280
<b>right</b>

12537
06:23:27,280 --> 06:23:29,316
<b>because most people are busy doing other things</b>

12538
06:23:30,383 --> 06:23:31,484
<b>back then with deep learning</b>

12539
06:23:31,484 --> 06:23:33,787
<b>people were doing whatever</b>

12540
06:23:33,787 --> 06:23:35,322
<b>other things</b>

12541
06:23:35,322 --> 06:23:36,289
<b>traditional machine learning</b>

12542
06:23:36,289 --> 06:23:37,457
<b>mm-hmm, and now</b>

12543
06:23:37,457 --> 06:23:38,258
<b>what you're doing is</b>

12544
06:23:38,258 --> 06:23:38,992
<b>you can, mm-hmm</b>

12545
06:23:38,992 --> 06:23:40,093
<b>let's not say it — think about it</b>

12546
06:23:40,427 --> 06:23:42,696
<b>[laughter]</b>

12547
06:23:42,696 --> 06:23:43,496
<b>and I think</b>

12548
06:23:43,496 --> 06:23:45,031
<b>he's actually quite optimistic</b>

12549
06:23:45,031 --> 06:23:46,700
<b>or rather he has</b>

12550
06:23:46,700 --> 06:23:47,767
<b>enough confidence</b>

12551
06:23:47,767 --> 06:23:49,502
<b>and says</b>

12552
06:23:49,636 --> 06:23:52,706
<b>the things I can see are important things</b>

12553
06:23:52,706 --> 06:23:54,107
<b>the path I can see</b>

12554
06:23:54,107 --> 06:23:55,442
<b>is a clear path</b>

12555
06:23:55,976 --> 06:23:58,445
<b>and on this matter</b>

12556
06:23:58,445 --> 06:23:59,479
<b>I still believe him quite a lot</b>

12557
06:23:59,512 --> 06:24:00,780
<b>Have you ever doubted him?</b>

12558
06:24:01,214 --> 06:24:01,615
<b>Uh</b>

12559
06:24:01,615 --> 06:24:02,315
<b>as I said</b>

12560
06:24:02,315 --> 06:24:03,183
<b>I questioned JEPA</b>

