<b>then understood JEPA</b>

12562
06:24:04,284 --> 06:24:05,085
<b>then became JEPA</b>

12563
06:24:05,118 --> 06:24:06,486
<b>so of course there was doubt</b>

12564
06:24:06,586 --> 06:24:08,822
<b>but I feel that trust in a person</b>

12565
06:24:08,822 --> 06:24:11,625
