12582
06:24:38,051 --> 06:24:40,053
<b>every time he gives that same talk</b>

12583
06:24:40,253 --> 06:24:42,188
<b>I've been feeling this very, very strongly recently</b>

12584
06:24:42,422 --> 06:24:43,256
<b>I said</b>

12585
06:24:43,923 --> 06:24:44,657
<b>this talk</b>

12586
