<b>I've watched it at least 10 times</b>

12587
06:24:48,328 --> 06:24:51,765
<b>20 times now, but each time I get something new</b>

12588
06:24:51,865 --> 06:24:53,233
<b>every time I feel</b>

12589
06:24:53,233 --> 06:24:57,303
<b>like I understand a bit more what he really means</b>

12590
06:24:57,370 --> 06:24:58,171
<b>and this</b>

12591
06:24:58,438 --> 06:25:00,907
<b>this deeper understanding</b>

12592
06:25:01,007 --> 06:25:04,644
<b>is not because I've watched the same content 10 or 20 times</b>

12593
06:25:04,711 --> 06:25:06,246
<b>and got this new understanding</b>

12594
06:25:06,513 --> 06:25:07,280
<b>it's because</b>

12595
06:25:07,280 --> 06:25:09,716
<b>I'm doing what I want to do</b>

12596
06:25:09,783 --> 06:25:10,583
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12597
06:25:11,217 --> 06:25:12,986
<b>and I find</b>

12598
06:25:12,986 --> 06:25:13,787
<b>that is</b>

12599
06:25:13,787 --> 06:25:15,789
<b>when watching his talk</b>

12600
06:25:15,789 --> 06:25:17,657
<b>each time I do this translation work</b>

12601
06:25:17,657 --> 06:25:18,458
<b>and association work</b>

12602
06:25:18,458 --> 06:25:19,426
<b>I find</b>

12603
06:25:19,426 --> 06:25:20,927
<b>that what he said</b>

12604
06:25:21,061 --> 06:25:23,129
<b>in my current understanding</b>

12605
06:25:23,830 --> 06:25:25,365
<b>can be interpreted this way</b>

12606
06:25:25,999 --> 06:25:30,270
<b>and it doesn't conflict at all with</b>

12607
06:25:30,270 --> 06:25:32,872
<b>even today's large language model or multimodal paradigms</b>

12608
06:25:33,506 --> 06:25:35,442
<b>everything</b>

12609
06:25:35,442 --> 06:25:39,412
