12611
06:25:40,380 --> 06:25:41,581
<b>concretely</b>

12612
06:25:41,781 --> 06:25:43,116
<b>and guide us</b>

12613
06:25:43,216 --> 06:25:45,518
<b>to perhaps escape some local optimum</b>

12614
06:25:46,720 --> 06:25:47,854
<b>[laughter]</b>

12615
06:25:47,854 --> 06:25:50,590
<b>and perhaps lead to a different future</b>

12616
06:25:50,590 --> 06:25:53,660
<b>mm-hmm, so it's become an inspiration</b>

12617
06:25:53,660 --> 06:25:53,993
<b>right?</b>

12618
06:25:53,993 --> 06:25:55,061
<b>it's not just knowledge</b>

12619
06:25:55,061 --> 06:25:56,296
<b>it's an inspiration</b>

12620
06:25:56,629 --> 06:25:57,230
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12621
06:25:57,230 --> 06:25:59,466
<b>so I think that's also wonderful</b>

12622
06:25:59,766 --> 06:26:00,567
<b>Mm-hmm</b>

12623
06:26:01,034 --> 06:26:03,403
<b>we just talked a lot about world models</b>

12624
06:26:03,570 --> 06:26:05,772
<b>do you have any new thoughts on your world model</b>

12625
06:26:06,272 --> 06:26:07,874
