12634
06:26:23,289 --> 06:26:27,227
<b>I go to work every day</b>

12635
06:26:27,227 --> 06:26:28,895
<b>first, I don't have to drive</b>

12636
06:26:28,995 --> 06:26:30,997
<b>so I've already started to emerge</b>

12637
06:26:30,997 --> 06:26:34,100
