12644
06:26:41,374 --> 06:26:44,310
<b>some days I'm still under quite a lot of pressure</b>

12645
06:26:45,011 --> 06:26:45,979
<b>sometimes something happens</b>

12646
06:26:45,979 --> 06:26:48,181
