12649
06:26:51,818 --> 06:26:53,620
<b>there's a park called Washington Square Park</b>

12650
06:26:53,620 --> 06:26:55,722
<b>Washington Square Park</b>

12651
06:26:55,722 --> 06:26:57,457
<b>[laughter]</b>

