12663
06:27:28,021 --> 06:27:30,390
<b>this roughly 5 to 10 minute walk</b>

12664
06:27:30,390 --> 06:27:31,424
<b>I find</b>

12665
06:27:31,658 --> 06:27:33,660
<b>the world is much bigger than we imagine</b>

12666
06:27:34,460 --> 06:27:37,797
<b>not everyone cares about what AI is</b>

12667
06:27:37,931 --> 06:27:39,432
<b>they may not care about this at all</b>

12668
06:27:40,366 --> 06:27:41,968
<b>and they have their own lives</b>

12669
