<b>do we have some kind of social responsibility?</b>

12676
06:27:56,115 --> 06:27:58,051
<b>but this might be getting a bit far-reaching</b>

12677
06:27:58,818 --> 06:27:59,919
<b>but I just feel</b>

12678
06:28:00,486 --> 06:28:01,654
